Package: EMMREML
Type: Package
Version: 5.2
Date: 2026-09-29
Title: Fitting Mixed Models with Known Covariance Structures and GWAS
Author: Deniz Akdemir, Okeke Uche Godfrey
Maintainer: Deniz Akdemir <deniz.akdemir.work@gmail.com>
Description: An improved mixed model solver that handles a variety of covariance 
    structures. The main functions are 'emmreml', 'emmremlMultiKernel', and 
    'emmremlMultivariate'. The 'emmreml' function solves mixed models with 
    known covariance structure using the 'EMMA' algorithm. 'emmremlMultiKernel' 
    allows for fitting models with multiple random components with known covariance 
    structures. The 'emmremlMultivariate' function solves multivariate Gaussian 
    mixed models with known covariance structures using the 'ECM' algorithm. The 
    package now offers both the original matrix interface (fully backward compatible
    with v3.1) and a modern formula interface. The 'emmremlMultivariate' function
    restores 'Gpred' and all test outputs from v3.1 while fixing ECM convergence.
    The new 'gwas' function provides genome-wide association studies with mixed
    models, including an accelerated algorithm and visualization options.
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5.0),
    Matrix,
    stats
